<title>SPAIN: Bankinter 96 net rises 12.10 pct.</title>
<headline>Bankinter 96 net rises 12.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996 earnings to end December</p>
<p>				    (billion pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				 17.14   vs  15.29</p>
<p> Pretax profit			    24.93   vs  21.97</p>
<p> Net interest income		    37.16   vs  34.39</p>
<p> Ordinary income			  60.60   vs  53.10</p>
<p> Operating income			 29.83   vs  23.25</p>
<p>NOTE - Name of Spanish bank is Bankinter.</p>
</text>
